{
"#name"
:
{
"cwe"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"The CWE command-line interface, powered by x-cmd, fetches the MITRE CWE catalog via curl."
,
"cn"
:
"CWE 命令行接口，由 x-cmd 驱动，通过 curl 从 MITRE CWE 拉取数据。"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- No API key needed. Data comes directly from the public MITRE CWE catalog.\n- First call downloads `2000.csv.zip` (~640 KB) and caches it locally.\n- Cached catalog rarely changes (30-day TTL); force a refresh with `x cwe update`.\n- The catalog is large (969+ entries) — use `x cwe fz` for interactive browsing or `x cwe ls --tsv | grep <pattern>` to script.\n- For the full upstream record (description, related weaknesses, mitigations, consequences, observed examples), use `x cwe info CWE-NNN`.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- 本地缓存无需 API key。数据直接来自公开的 MITRE CWE 目录。\n- 首次调用会下载 `2000.csv.zip`（约 640 KB）并缓存到本地。\n- 目录更新缓慢（30 天 TTL）；使用 `x cwe update` 强制刷新。\n- 目录很大（969+ 条目）——使用 `x cwe fz` 交互浏览，或 `x cwe ls --tsv | grep <pattern>` 脚本化处理。\n- 查看完整上游记录（描述、关联弱点、缓解措施、后果、观察示例），使用 `x cwe info CWE-NNN`。\n"
}
]
,
"info"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Look up one or more CWE records by id (full description, related weaknesses, mitigations, consequences, etc.)"
,
"cn"
:
"通过 id 查询一条或多条 CWE 完整记录（描述、关联弱点、缓解措施、后果等）"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://cwe/data/info.jso"
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Stream every cached CWE row. TTY → fzf picker; pipe → TSV. Auto-refreshes if cache is stale (>30 days)."
,
"cn"
:
"流式输出所有已缓存的 CWE 行。TTY 自动进入 fzf；管道输出 TSV；若缓存超过 30 天则自动刷新。"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://cwe/data/la.jso"
}
,
"fz"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Interactive fzf picker over every cached CWE"
,
"cn"
:
"对所有已缓存 CWE 的交互式 fzf 选择器"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://cwe/data/fz.jso"
}
,
"update"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Refresh the local CWE cache from MITRE"
,
"cn"
:
"从 MITRE 刷新本地 CWE 缓存"
}
}
,
"data"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Manage the local CWE cache; query its location, status, and base URL"
,
"cn"
:
"管理本地 CWE 缓存；查询路径、状态、远程地址"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-advise://cwe/data/data.jso"
}
,
"--|info"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"`x cwe info` shortcut — treat bare arg as a CWE id"
,
"cn"
:
"`x cwe info` 的简写：裸参数视为 CWE id"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"CWE id, e.g. CWE-79 or 79"
,
"cn"
:
"CWE id，例如 CWE-79 或 79"
}
}
}
}

